ow (step_13), and the 132\u2013738 interaction is in the reverse direction (step_10), so a simple temporal chain is not evident. Given the lack of per-event timing information to demonstrate a sequence of events with the required temporal ordering and 600-unit gaps, the temporal evidence is insufficient to conclude presence or absence of a cascade.\"\n}", "total_input_tokens": 40439, "total_output_tokens": 6011, "total_tokens": 46450, "total_latency_ms": 84632, "llm_calls": 14, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}